          },
          "label": "Checked with DataXray",
          "value": "<p>DataXray was asked about <b>{{existsCandidates}}</b> file asset(s) by DataXray Datasource ID and Object ID: <b>{{existsRefreshed}}</b> still in DataXray (refreshed: attributes and classification links, a removed label now <i>formerly groups</i>), <b>{{existsNotInDataXray}}</b> no longer there (status <i>Not in DataXray</i>), {{existsNoKey}} not checked (no object key stored yet).</p>",
          "defaultValue": false,
